---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Timeline from '../components/Timeline.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | Hayden Smith" description="Florida background, Carnegie Mellon, and the path toward investment banking.">
	<section class="wrap intro">
		<a class="back-link" href="/">&larr; Back to the beach</a>
		<p class="eyebrow">About Me</p>
		<h1>Where it started</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			I grew up in Florida: a twin, working since 2021, in a family without much financial cushion. I'm studying Business Administration at Carnegie Mellon's Tepper School, with a finance concentration and an additional major in statistics, where a general interest in numbers turned into a specific one. Learning to build a view and then defend it is what pulled me toward investment banking, and it's the thread running from a beach town to where I'm headed now.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="wrap">
		<Timeline />
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.intro {
		padding-block: 1rem 2.5rem;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;
	}

	.lede {
		font-size: 1.1rem;
		color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 82%, transparent);
		max-width: 56ch;
	}
</style>
